@mainpage Introduction

@htmlonly
<script>document.currentScript.closest('.contents').previousElementSibling.style.display='none';</script>
<div class="mainpage-hero">
  <img src="logo.svg" alt="GroveDB for C++">
</div>
@endhtmlonly

GroveDB is a hierarchical authenticated database. It organizes data as trees
within trees, where a single 32-byte root hash cryptographically commits to
the entire database state. Any query result — including range queries and
secondary index lookups — can be proven correct against that root hash.

