| @ref guide-elements-and-trees "Elements & Trees" | Data organization as trees within trees |
| @ref guide-basic-operations "Basic Operations" | Put, get, delete, and cost tracking |
| @ref guide-queries "Queries" | Range queries and lookups beyond single keys |
| @ref guide-proofs "Cryptographic Proofs" | Generate and verify proofs for any query result |
| @ref guide-transactions "Transactions" | Optimistic transaction semantics for updates |
