| @ref guide-advanced-topics "Advanced Topics" | Checkpoints, auxiliary storage, and sum trees |
| @ref guide-error-handling "Error Handling" | Result types for safe error propagation |
| @ref guide-glossary "Glossary" | Key terminology and concept definitions |

